warning, "You sense a faint wave of psychic energy."  Double crap!

I got to the stairs and checked my inventory.  Nothing helpful on me except
rings of invisibilty and conflict.  I put it them and risked going back
down.  Sure enough the bones pile was right near the stairs.  I picked out
what I could - potions, scrolls, and hmm a lamp.  Another warning on the
grave though, "<somebody> killed by an invisible Golden Naga."  Triple crap!
I got it all and headed back to the altar in gnometown.  Everything was
cursed but Izchak confirmed my lamp as magic.

So I blessed the lamp and thought for what could help me down there.  A wand
